{"id":"n64512-1-17","stage":3,"title":"국물 · 汤水","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64512-1-17-1","ko":"승규야, 옷에 이 빨간색 자국이 뭐야?","zh":"承奎，你衣服上的这个红色印子是什么啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규야,","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"옷에","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빨간색","meaning":"红色","explanation":"빨간색：红色","readings":[{"term":"빨간색","audio":"/audio/312153cf826c5582fb77.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26849","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨간색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자국이","meaning":"痕迹","explanation":"자국：痕迹；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"자국","audio":"/audio/0d781af131d0d7e0b149.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90333","senseId":"1","lemma":"자국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐야?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"312153cf826c5582","term":"빨간색","zh":"红色","audio":"/audio/312153cf826c5582fb77.mp3","entryId":"26849","definition":"像鲜血、熟透的苹果、辣椒般红红的颜色。","pronunciation":["빨간색"]},{"id":"0d781af131d0d7e0","term":"자국","zh":"痕迹","audio":"/audio/0d781af131d0d7e0b149.mp3","entryId":"90333","definition":"别的东西触碰或沾贴而产生的形迹；或指由于受某事物的影响，原物变形的印痕。","pronunciation":["자국"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/168088d1ac1b42b77f4a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64512-1-17-2","ko":"아까 점심을 먹다가 찌개 국물이 옷에 튀었어요.","zh":"刚才吃午饭的时候，汤汁溅到衣服上了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65974","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"점심을","meaning":"中饭，午饭，午餐","explanation":"점심：中饭，午饭，午餐；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"점심","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70868","senseId":"1","lemma":"점심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹다가","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찌개","meaning":"浓汤，汤，锅","explanation":"찌개：浓汤，汤，锅","readings":[{"term":"찌개","audio":"/audio/ab54be0a69403de061db.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26901","senseId":"1","lemma":"찌개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"국물이","meaning":"汤水，汤汁","explanation":"국물：汤水，汤汁；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"국물","audio":"/audio/28fc4f685e87f9f4926f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64512","senseId":"1","lemma":"국물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옷에","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"튀었어요.","meaning":"弹，射，迸溅，爆裂","explanation":"튀다：弹，射，迸溅，爆裂；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"튀다","audio":"/audio/1e864f31429430eb1370.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82391","senseId":"2","lemma":"튀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚才，方才，刚刚","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65974","definition":"不久以前。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"12cf30d1ce4feda7","term":"점심","zh":"中饭，午饭，午餐","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3","entryId":"70868","definition":"早餐和晚餐之间，白天吃的饭。","pronunciation":["점ː심"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"ab54be0a69403de0","term":"찌개","zh":"浓汤，汤，锅","audio":"/audio/ab54be0a69403de061db.mp3","entryId":"26901","definition":"一种微咸的菜肴，在容器中放入少量汤汁后放入肉、豆腐或蔬菜等食材，再放入适量的辣椒酱或大酱等作料和酱油煮制而成。","pronunciation":["찌개"]},{"id":"28fc4f685e87f9f4","term":"국물","zh":"汤水，汤汁","audio":"/audio/28fc4f685e87f9f4926f.mp3","entryId":"64512","definition":"在清汤或浓汤等食物里，除去汤料以外剩下的水。","pronunciation":["궁물"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"1e864f31429430eb","term":"튀다","zh":"弹，射，迸溅，爆裂","audio":"/audio/1e864f31429430eb1370.mp3","entryId":"82391","definition":"小物、液滴等由于受力而向四处猛烈散开。","pronunciation":["튀다"]}],"audio":"/audio/dcb0a7676df3e0580768.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.136,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64512","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":97,"sequenceScore":2.5867,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["刚才吃午饭的时候，汤汁溅到衣服上了。","现在已经是新的一年了，你制定年度计划了吗？","承奎，你衣服上的这个红色印子是什么啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["刚才吃午饭的时候，汤汁溅到衣服上了。","承奎，你衣服上的这个红色印子是什么啊？","现在已经是新的一年了，你制定年度计划了吗？"],"answer":0}]}
